---
title: "1. Signing up and signing in"
---
flowchart TD
    S([Person fills in the<br/>sign-up or sign-in form]):::start --> G{Safety check:<br/>is the form genuine and<br/>not being sent over and over?}:::question
    G -- No --> GX([Stop and ask them<br/>to try again shortly]):::stop
    G -- Yes --> F{Signing up or<br/>signing in?}:::question

    F -- Signing up --> U1{Are the name and<br/>email filled in properly?}:::question
    U1 -- No --> UX([Show what needs fixing]):::stop
    U1 -- Yes --> U2{Is the password strong?<br/>8+ characters, a capital letter,<br/>a number and a symbol}:::question
    U2 -- No --> UX
    U2 -- Yes --> U3{Is that email<br/>already registered?}:::question
    U3 -- Yes --> UX2([Suggest signing in instead]):::stop
    U3 -- No --> U4[Scramble the password so the<br/>real one is never stored,<br/>then create the account]:::step
    U4 --> OK1([Signed in: take them to<br/>the page they wanted]):::good

    F -- Signing in --> I1{Is sign-in locked after<br/>3 wrong tries?}:::question
    I1 -- Yes --> IX1([Ask them to try again<br/>in 15 minutes]):::stop
    I1 -- No --> I2{Are the email and<br/>password correct?}:::question
    I2 -- Yes --> OK2([Signed in: take them to<br/>the page they wanted]):::good
    I2 -- No --> I3{Was that the<br/>3rd wrong try?}:::question
    I3 -- No --> IX2(["Show 'Incorrect email or password<br/>(attempt 1 or 2 out of 3)'"]):::stop
    I3 -- Yes --> IX3([Lock sign-in for 15 minutes]):::stop

    classDef start fill:#232f3e,stroke:#232f3e,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold
    classDef step fill:#ffffff,stroke:#232f3e,color:#0f1111
    classDef question fill:#fff0d6,stroke:#a35c00,color:#0f1111
    classDef good fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#1e7e34,color:#0f1111,font-weight:bold
    classDef stop fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e,color:#0f1111
    classDef note fill:#f0f2f2,stroke:#6f7777,color:#0f1111,stroke-dasharray:4 3
